TEST-ONLY KEY - DO NOT USE FOR ANYTHING ELSE.

This RSA private key is a public test fixture for pgbearer_auth::testing::MockIssuer
(Cargo feature "testing"). It was generated once with
"openssl genrsa -traditional 2048" and is committed on purpose so that the mock
identity provider can mint RS256/PS256 test tokens without generating RSA keys at
run time. It protects nothing: anyone can read it, so never trust it anywhere.

